    "is_free": true,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/8a6b37e3f44c5390229326cbb51735cc.avif?t=1749283338\" width=630 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/938bf5f66e713c7b40cd81025ba36677.avif?t=1749283338\" width=700 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ranch has been burnt down, but there are traces of the perpetrator &quot;EquinoCorp&quot; at the scene! You set off into the city to investigate the mystery behind its destruction, and to get revenge while somewhat helping out others along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player narrative game where you play as a quirky wannabe cowboy exploring the dystopian futuristic world for his own revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/b0ac9937c906b50b3677a902dc9b3790.poster.avif?t=1749283338\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/b0ac9937c906b50b3677a902dc9b3790.webm?t=1749283338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/938bf5f66e713c7b40cd81025ba36677.avif?t=1749283338\" width=700 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A Linear Story with Branching Narrative Choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wonderful Cast of Characters (including yourself as the titular Cowboy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interrogating suspects and chasing leads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A variety of mini-games to shake up the pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Animated cutscenes for every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/938bf5f66e713c7b40cd81025ba36677.avif?t=1749283338\" width=700 height=95 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/f3e1f1eaa0585293ad8d076b6897df46.avif?t=1749283338\" width=630 height=172 /></span></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/8a6b37e3f44c5390229326cbb51735cc.avif?t=1749283338\" width=630 height=172 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/938bf5f66e713c7b40cd81025ba36677.avif?t=1749283338\" width=700 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Summary</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your ranch has been burnt down, but there are traces of the perpetrator &quot;EquinoCorp&quot; at the scene! You set off into the city to investigate the mystery behind its destruction, and to get revenge while somewhat helping out others along the way!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A single-player narrative game where you play as a quirky wannabe cowboy exploring the dystopian futuristic world for his own revenge.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/b0ac9937c906b50b3677a902dc9b3790.poster.avif?t=1749283338\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/b0ac9937c906b50b3677a902dc9b3790.webm?t=1749283338\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/938bf5f66e713c7b40cd81025ba36677.avif?t=1749283338\" width=700 height=95 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A Linear Story with Branching Narrative Choices</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Wonderful Cast of Characters (including yourself as the titular Cowboy!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Interrogating suspects and chasing leads</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- A variety of mini-games to shake up the pace</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-Animated cutscenes for every level</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/938bf5f66e713c7b40cd81025ba36677.avif?t=1749283338\" width=700 height=95 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3399440/extras/f3e1f1eaa0585293ad8d076b6897df46.avif?t=1749283338\" width=630 height=172 /></span></p>",
